WEBVTT


00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.920
Legend tells of a legendary warrior...


00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.040
...whose kung fu skills
were the stuff of legend.


00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:48.480
He traveled the land
in search of worthy foes.


00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:03.400
I see you like to chew.
Maybe you should chew on my fist!


00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:06.840
The warrior said nothing,
for his mouth was full.


00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.960
Then he swallowed. And then he spoke.


00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.240
Enough talk. Let's fight!


00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:13.680
Shashabooey!


00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:18.280
He was so deadly in fact,


00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.920
that his enemies would go blind from
overexposure to pure awesomeness.


00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:24.080
- My eyes!
- He's too awesome!


00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.800
- And attractive.
- How can we repay you?


00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.920
There is no charge for awesomeness.


00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:32.480
Or attractiveness.


00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:33.760
Kablooey!


00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.480
It mattered not how many foes he faced.


00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:39.280
They were no match for his bodacity!


00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:55.760
Never before had a panda
been so feared! And so loved.


00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.200
Even the most heroic heroes in China,


00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.400
the Furious Five,


00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:04.280
bowed in respect
to this great master.


00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.080
We should hang out.


00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:07.240
Agreed.


00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.040
But hanging out would have to wait.


00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:16.360
Because when you're facing
the 10,000 demons of Demon Mountain,


00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.120
there's only one thing
that matters and that's...


00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:20.880
Po! Get up!


00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:22.640
You'll be later for work!


00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:23.920
What?


00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:32.320
Po! Get up!


00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.360
Po. What are you doing up there?


00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:51.680
Nothing.


00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.640
Monkey! Mantis! Orange! Viper! Tigress!


00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:08.000
Po! Let's go! You're late for work.


00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.360
Coming!


00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:20.440
Sorry, Dad.


00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:23.200
Sorry doesn't make the noodles.


00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:25.560
What were you doing up there?
All that noise.


00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.000
Nothing. I just had a crazy dream.


00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:29.280
About what?


00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:30.840
What were you dreaming about?


00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:32.400
What was I?


00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.120
I was dreaming about...


00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.040
...noodles.


00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:42.000
Noodles? You were really
dreaming about noodles?


00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.520
Yeah. What else
would I be dreaming about?


00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.960
Careful! That soup is sharp.


00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.440
Oh, happy day!


00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:52.240
My son, finally having the noodle dream!


00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:57.400
You don't know how long I've been
waiting for this moment.


00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.280
This is a sign, Po.


00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:01.080
A sign of what?


00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:05.600
You are almost ready to be entrusted
with the secret ingredient


00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.840
of my Secret Ingredient Soup.


00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:12.800
Then you will fulfill your destiny
and take over the restaurant!


00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:16.240
As I took it over from my father,
who took it over from his father...


00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:18.880
...who won it from a friend in mahjong.


00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.520
Dad, Dad, Dad, it was just a dream.


00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.800
No, it was the dream.


00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:27.280
We are noodle folk.
Broth runs through our veins.


00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:31.080
But, Dad, didn't you ever want
to do something else?


00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.960
Something besides noodles?


00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.840
Actually, when I was young and crazy,


00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:39.800
I thought about running away
and learning how to make tofu.


00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:40.960
Why didn't you?


00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.720
Because it was a stupid dream.


00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:46.720
Can you imagine me making tofu?


00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.120
Tofu.


00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:52.480
No! We all have our place in this world.


00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.000
Mine is here, and yours is...


00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:56.240
I know, is here.


00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:59.320
No, it's at tables 2, 5, 7, and 12


00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.360
Service with a smile.


00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:33.600
Well done, students...
if you were trying to disappoint me.


00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.680
Tigress, you need more ferocity!
Monkey, greater speed.


00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:39.520
Orange, height. Viper, subtlety.
Mantis...


00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.360
- Master Shifu.
- What?!


00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.760
It's Master Oogway. He wants to see you.


00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:57.520
Master Oogway, you summoned me?
Is something wrong?


00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:07.840
Why must something be wrong
for me to want to see my old friend?


00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:09.960
So, nothing's wrong?


00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:12.560
Well, I didn't say that.


00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.480
You were saying?


00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:34.520
I have had a vision.


00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.200
Tai Lung will return.


00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.400
That is impossible! He is in prison.


00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:47.120
Nothing is impossible.


00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:48.920
Zeng!


00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:51.200
Fly to Chorh-Gom prison and tell them


00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:54.480
to double the guards, double
their weapons, double everything!


00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.360
Tai Lung does not leave that prison!


00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.840
Yes, Master Shifu!


00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:04.560
One often meets his destiny
on the road he takes to avoid it.


00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:08.440
We must do something! We can't let him
march on the valley, take his revenge!


00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:09.480
He'll...


00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:11.760
Your mind is like this water,
my friend.


00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:15.120
When it is agitated,
it becomes difficult to see.


00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.160
But if you allow it to settle...


00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:21.120
...the answer becomes clear.


00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.000
The Dragon Scroll.


00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.320
It is time.


00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:32.960
But who? Who is worthy to be trusted
with the secret to limitless power?


00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:37.560
To become the Dragon Warrior?


00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.040
I don't know.


00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.640
Excuse me. Pardon me. Sorry.


00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:44.480
Watch it!


00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:46.000
Sorry. Suck it up!


00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.000
Sorry. A thousand pardons.


00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.000
What?


00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:56.160
Master Oogway's choosing
the Dragon Warrior! Today!


00:07:56.240 --> 00:08:00.640
Everyone! Get to the Jade Palace! One of
the Five is gonna get the Dragon Scroll!


00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:03.640
We've waited 1,000 years for this!
Take the bowl!


00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:07.680
This is the greatest day
in kung fu history! Just go!


00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.680
Po! Where are you going?


00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.800
To the Jade Palace.


00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.040
You're forgetting your noodle cart.


00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.480
The whole valley will be there,
and you'll sell noodles to all of them.


00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:20.920
Selling noodles?


00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.800
But, Dad, I was thinking, maybe I...


00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:27.920
- Yeah?
- I was thinking maybe I...


00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:35.960
...could also sell the bean buns.
They're about to go bad.


00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.680
That's my boy!


00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.920
I told you that dream was a sign.


00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:42.800
Yeah. Glad I had it.


00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:49.120
- I'm a kung fu warrior!
- Me, too!


00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.640
- There's spots at the top.
- Let's go.


00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:27.360
Come on. Come on!


00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.240
Almost there.


00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.400
What?


00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:33.040
No! Oh, no!


00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:38.680
- Sorry, Po.
- We'll bring you back a souvenir.


00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:46.320
No. I'll bring me back a souvenir.


00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.640
It is an historic day.


00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.400
Isn't it, Master Oogway?


00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:59.160
Yes, and one I feared
I would not live to see.


00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.120
Are your students ready?


00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.880
Yes, Master Oogway.


00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.680
Know this, old friend.


00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:09.920
Whomever I choose will not only bring
peace to the valley...


00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.480
...but also to you.


00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:16.160
Let the tournament begin!


00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:19.680
Let the tournament begin!


00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.960
Yeah.


00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.520
No, no, wait!


00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:37.840
I'm coming! Wait, wait!


00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.080
Yes!


00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:44.240
Hey! Open the door!


00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.040
Let me in!


00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.560
Citizens of the Valley of Peace,


00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:55.200
it is my great honor
to present to you... Tigress!


00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:59.240
Viper! Orange! Monkey! Mantis!


00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:00.600
The Furious Five!


00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.240
Yeah, the Furious Five!


00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:17.760
Warriors, prepare!


00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:20.280
Wait. No. Oh, peeky-hole.


00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.600
- Ready for battle!
- Yeah.


00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:25.520
The Thousand Tongues of Fire.


00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:28.800
Look at that.


00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:30.800
Hey! Get out of the way!


00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:05.840
And finally Master Tigress!


00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:11.440
And believe me, citizens,
you have not seen anything yet.


00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:12.720
I know!


00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:17.680
Master Tigress! Face Iron Ox
and his Blades of Death.


00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:33.840
I sense the Dragon Warrior is among us.


00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:41.680
Citizens of the Valley of Peace,


00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:46.080
Master Oogway will now choose
the Dragon Warrior!


00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.120
Oh, no! No, no, wait!


00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:51.760
Yeah.


00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:08.600
Po!


00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:10.520
What are you doing?!


00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.040
What does it look like I'm doing?! Stop!


00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.960
I'm going to see the Dragon Warrior!


00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:22.080
But I don't understand.
You finally had the noodle dream!


00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:25.840
I lied. I don't dream
about noodles, Dad.


00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:31.920
I love kung fu!


00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:48.240
Come on, son. Let's get back to work.


00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.080
OK.


00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.600
Come back!


00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.560
What's going on?


00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:26.880
Where?


00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:30.800
What are you pointing?


00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:35.320
OK. Sorry.


00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.760
I just wanted to see
who the Dragon Warrior was.


00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:39.680
How interesting.


00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:42.920
Master, are you pointing at me?


00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.920
- Him.
- Who?


00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:48.960
- You.
- Me?


00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:54.320
The universe has brought us
the Dragon Warrior!


00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.920
- What?
- What?!


00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.600
- What?!
- What?!


00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:09.560
Stop, wait! Who told you to?


00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.160
Master Oogway, wait.


00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:24.320
That flabby panda can't possibly be
the answer to our problem.


00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:27.920
You were about to point at Tigress
and that thing fell in front of her!


00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.360
That was just an accident!


00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:32.080
There are no accidents.


00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.240
Forgive us, Master. We have failed you.


00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:52.480
No. If the panda
has not quit by morning


00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.800
then I will have failed you.


00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.960
Wait! Wait, wait, wait!
I bring a message...


00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.200
...from Master Shifu.


00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:22.800
What?!


00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.160
"Double the guard?!"


00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.920
"Extra precautions?!"


00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.240
"Your prison may not be adequate?!"


00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:34.520
You doubt my prison security?!


00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.400
Absolutely not.


00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:39.480
Shifu does. I'm just the messenger.


00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:43.000
I'll give you a message
for your Master Shifu.


00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.640
Escape from Chorh-Gom prison
is impossible!


00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:53.520
Impressive, isn't it?


00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:56.160
It's very impressive.


00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.680
It's very impressive.


00:16:57.760 --> 00:17:00.320
One way in, one way out.


00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:04.280
One thousand guards and one prisoner.


00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:06.800
Yes, except that prisoner...


00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.480
...is Tai Lung.


00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:14.080
Take us down.


00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:20.640
What are you doing?


00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.960
Oh, my.


00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:39.960
Behold Tai Lung.


00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:44.520
I'm just gonna wait right here.


00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:48.720
It's nothing to worry about.
It's perfectly safe.


00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.960
Crossbows! At the ready!


00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:52.760
Crossbows?


00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.280
Hey, tough guy, did you hear?


00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:59.640
Oogway’s giving someone the Dragon
Scroll, and it's not gonna be you.


00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.320
Don't get him mad.


00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:06.000
What's he gonna do about it?
I've got him completely immobilized.


00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:13.880
Did I step on the wittle kitty's tail?


00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.680
I'm good. I've seen enough.


00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:18.080
I'll tell Shifu he
has nothing to worry about.


00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.320
No, he doesn't.


00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.520
I'll tell him that.


00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:23.360
Can we please go now?


00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:41.120
Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!


00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:41.600
Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!


00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.480
Wait a second!


00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:57.760
I think there's been a slight mistake.
Everyone seems to think that I'm...


00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:03.760
The Sacred Hall of Warriors! No way!


00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:06.080
Look at this place.


00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:12.400
Master Flying Rhino's armor,
with authentic battle damage!


00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:16.160
The Sword of Heroes!


00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:19.360
Said to be so sharp you can cut yourself
just by looking.


00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:23.920
The Invisible Trident of Destiny!


00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:28.560
I've only seen paintings
of that painting.


00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.080
No!


00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:40.000
The legendary Urn
of Whispering Warriors.


00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.120
Said to contain the souls
of the entire Tenshu Army.


00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:47.440
Hello.


00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.760
Have you finished sight-seeing?


00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.800
Sorry, I should have come to you first.


00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:53.760
My patience is wearing thin.


00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:56.560
Well, I mean, it's not like you
were going anywhere.


00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:58.880
- Would you turn around?
- Sure.


00:19:58.960 --> 00:19:59.960
How's it going?


00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.360
How do you get 5,000...
Master Shifu!


00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:06.560
Someone... broke that.


00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.880
But I'll fix it. Do you have some...


00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:10.960
...glue?


00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:14.800
A splinter.


00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.720
So you're the legendary Dragon Warrior?


00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:20.800
- I guess so.
- Wrong!


00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:24.480
You are not the Dragon Warrior. You will
never be the Dragon Warrior until...


00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:27.360
...you have learned the secret
of the Dragon Scroll.


00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:31.800
So, how does this work?


00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:34.640
Do you have a ladder,
or a trampoline, or?


00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:39.800
You think it's that easy?
That I'll just hand you the secret


00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:41.680
- to limitless power?
- No, I...


00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.640
One must first master
the highest level of kung fu.


00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:48.600
And that is impossible
if that one is someone like you.


00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:49.680
Someone like me?


00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:54.240
Yes, look at you!
This fat butt! Flabby arms!


00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:56.640
Those are sensitive in the flabby parts.


00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:59.440
And this ridiculous belly.


00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:02.640
And utter disregard
for personal hygiene.


00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.800
Now, wait a minute.
That's uncalled for.


00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:07.280
Don't stand that close.
I can smell your breath.


00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:09.160
Listen, Oogway said I was...


00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:11.800
The Wuxi Finger Hold.
Not the Wuxi Finger Hold!


00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:14.480
Oh, you know this hold?


00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:17.080
Developed by Master Wuxi
in the Third Dynasty.


00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:19.840
Then you know what happens
when I flex my pinky.


00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:23.200
- No, no!
- You know the hardest part of this?


00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:27.000
The hardest part is cleaning up
afterwards.


00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.080
OK, OK, take it easy.


00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:31.520
Now listen closely, panda.


00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:34.560
Oogway may have picked you,
but when I'm through with you,


00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:39.360
I promise you, you're going to wish
he hadn't! Are we clear?


00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:42.520
Yeah, we're clear. We're so clear.


00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:44.240
Good.


00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:46.160
I can't wait to get started.


00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:26.320
- Let's begin.
- Wait, wait, wait.


00:22:26.600 --> 00:22:27.840
What?


00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:31.720
- Now?
- Yes, now.


00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:35.920
Unless the great Oogway was wrong
and you are not the Dragon Warrior.


00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.480
Oh, OK, well...


00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:41.400
I don't know
if I can do all of those moves.


00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:44.120
Well, if we don't try,
we'll never know, will we?


00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:47.840
Yeah, it's just, maybe we can find
something more suited to my level.


00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:48.920
What level is that?


00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:52.320
Well, I'm not a master, but...


00:22:52.400 --> 00:22:55.040
...let's just start at zero. Level zero.


00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:59.040
No. There is no such thing
as level zero.


00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:01.760
- Maybe I can start with that.
- That?


00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:06.720
We use that for training children and
propping the door open when it's hot.


00:23:06.760 --> 00:23:08.080
But if you insist...


00:23:08.160 --> 00:23:10.800
The Furious Five!


00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:14.960
You're bigger than your action figures.
Except, you, Mantis. You're the same.


00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:20.560
Go ahead, panda.
Show us what you can do.


00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:25.600
Are they gonna watch, or should I wait
till they get back to work?


00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:26.600
Hit it.


00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:31.160
OK, yeah. I mean, I just ate.
So I'm still digesting.


00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:34.840
So my kung fu might not be
as good as... later on.


00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:35.960
Just hit it.


00:23:36.800 --> 00:23:37.880
All right.


00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:42.080
What you got? You got nothing,
'cause I got it right here.


00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:45.040
You picking on my friends?
Get ready to feel thunder.


00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:47.200
I'm coming at you with crazy feet.


00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.160
Come on. I'm a blur.
You've never seen bear style.


00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:51.960
You've only seen praying mantis.


00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:53.880
Or monkey style.


00:23:54.520 --> 00:23:56.760
Or I could come at you snickety-snake.


00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:59.080
Would you hit it!


00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:01.240
All right. All right.


00:24:06.720 --> 00:24:09.680
Why don't you try again?
A little harder.


00:24:11.360 --> 00:24:12.560
How's that?


00:24:22.880 --> 00:24:24.320
That hurts.


00:24:31.040 --> 00:24:33.120
This will be easier than I thought.


00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:35.600
I'm feeling a little nauseous!


00:24:36.400 --> 00:24:37.640
Those are hard!


00:24:41.840 --> 00:24:43.200
My tenders.


00:25:10.160 --> 00:25:11.800
How did I do?


00:25:11.840 --> 00:25:15.520
There is now a level zero.


00:25:15.560 --> 00:25:15.680
- There's no words.
- No denying that.


00:25:15.680 --> 00:25:17.880
- There's no words.
- No denying that.


00:25:17.920 --> 00:25:20.160
What was Master Oogway thinking?


00:25:20.240 --> 00:25:22.440
The poor guy's gonna get himself killed.


00:25:22.520 --> 00:25:24.920
He is so mighty!


00:25:24.960 --> 00:25:29.600
The Dragon Warrior fell out of the sky
on a ball of fire!


00:25:29.680 --> 00:25:32.400
When he walks, the very ground shakes!


00:25:33.360 --> 00:25:37.440
One would think Master Oogway would
choose someone who knew kung fu.


00:25:37.520 --> 00:25:39.480
Yeah, or could at least touch his toes.


00:25:39.520 --> 00:25:41.840
Or even see his toes.


00:26:05.200 --> 00:26:06.320
OK.


00:26:14.760 --> 00:26:16.320
Great.


00:26:30.560 --> 00:26:32.120
Hi. You're up.


00:26:32.160 --> 00:26:33.520
I am now.


00:26:33.680 --> 00:26:35.040
I was just...


00:26:35.080 --> 00:26:36.920
Some day, huh?


00:26:36.960 --> 00:26:41.200
That kung fu stuff is hard work, right?
Are your biceps sore?


00:26:42.200 --> 00:26:46.800
I've had a long
and rather disappointing day, so...


00:26:47.520 --> 00:26:50.720
Yeah, I should probably
get to sleep now.


00:26:50.800 --> 00:26:53.120
- Yeah, yeah, yeah. Of course.
- OK, thanks.


00:26:53.160 --> 00:26:55.920
It's just...
Man, I'm such a big fan!


00:26:56.000 --> 00:26:58.560
You guys were amazing
at the Battle of Weeping River.


00:26:58.640 --> 00:27:02.000
Outnumbered a thousand to one,
but you didn't stop. You just...


00:27:04.640 --> 00:27:06.880
Sorry about that.


00:27:06.960 --> 00:27:09.360
Look, you don't belong here.


00:27:11.000 --> 00:27:13.760
I know. I know. You're right.


00:27:13.840 --> 00:27:16.240
I don't have... I just...


00:27:16.320 --> 00:27:17.760
My whole life I dreamed of...


00:27:17.840 --> 00:27:22.520
No, I meant you don't belong here.
I mean, in this room. This is my room.


00:27:23.840 --> 00:27:25.800
Property of Orange.


00:27:25.880 --> 00:27:27.680
OK. Right, right.


00:27:27.720 --> 00:27:30.160
So, you want to get to sleep.


00:27:30.240 --> 00:27:31.960
- Yeah.
- I'm keeping you up.


00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:34.040
We got big things tomorrow.


00:27:34.120 --> 00:27:38.160
All right. You're awesome.
Last thing I'm gonna say. Bye-bye.


00:27:41.840 --> 00:27:42.960
What was that?


00:27:43.040 --> 00:27:44.400
I didn't say anything.


00:27:44.480 --> 00:27:46.520
OK. All right. Good night.


00:27:46.600 --> 00:27:47.760
Sleep well.


00:27:50.440 --> 00:27:52.240
That seemed a little awkward.


00:27:54.120 --> 00:27:56.520
Master Tigress!
I didn't mean to wake you.


00:27:56.600 --> 00:27:59.200
- You don't belong here.
- Yeah, of course.


00:27:59.240 --> 00:28:00.480
This is your room.


00:28:00.560 --> 00:28:03.720
I mean, you don't belong
in the Jade Palace.


00:28:03.800 --> 00:28:06.080
You're a disgrace to kung fu,
and if you have


00:28:06.120 --> 00:28:09.600
any respect for who we are
and what we do,


00:28:09.920 --> 00:28:12.000
you will be gone by morning.


00:28:17.240 --> 00:28:18.800
Big fan!


00:28:25.920 --> 00:28:29.600
I see you have found the Sacred
Peach Tree of Heavenly Wisdom.


00:28:31.840 --> 00:28:36.320
Is that what this is? Sorry. I thought
it was just a regular peach tree.


00:28:36.400 --> 00:28:41.120
I understand.
You eat when you are upset.


00:28:41.200 --> 00:28:45.040
Upset? I'm not upset.
What makes you think I'm upset.


00:28:46.240 --> 00:28:48.560
So why are you so upset?


00:28:53.480 --> 00:28:56.880
I probably sucked more today
than anyone in the history of kung fu.


00:28:56.960 --> 00:29:00.440
In the history of China.
In the history of sucking!


00:29:00.480 --> 00:29:01.560
Probably.


00:29:01.600 --> 00:29:05.160
And the Five! Man, you should've
seen them! They totally hate me.


00:29:05.240 --> 00:29:06.200
Totally.


00:29:06.240 --> 00:29:10.160
How is Shifu ever going to turn me
into the Dragon Warrior?


00:29:12.200 --> 00:29:14.040
I mean, I'm not like the Five.


00:29:14.080 --> 00:29:17.520
I've got no claws, no wings, no venom.


00:29:17.600 --> 00:29:20.400
Even Mantis has those... thingies.


00:29:21.920 --> 00:29:25.200
Maybe I should just quit
and go back to making noodles.


00:29:28.240 --> 00:29:30.320
Quit, don't quit.


00:29:30.400 --> 00:29:34.240
Noodles, don't noodles.


00:29:34.320 --> 00:29:38.800
You are too concerned
with what was and what will be.


00:29:38.880 --> 00:29:40.640
There's a saying:


00:29:40.720 --> 00:29:43.040
Yesterday is history,


00:29:43.160 --> 00:29:45.480
tomorrow is a mystery,


00:29:45.520 --> 00:29:48.520
but today is a gift.


00:29:48.600 --> 00:29:51.280
That is why it is called the present.


00:30:20.040 --> 00:30:22.320
- Oh, no!
- What's happening?!


00:30:22.400 --> 00:30:24.760
To your battle stations! Go! Go! Go!


00:30:33.160 --> 00:30:34.720
Fire crossbows!


00:30:34.800 --> 00:30:36.080
Fire!


00:30:38.600 --> 00:30:39.600
Fire!


00:30:46.920 --> 00:30:49.520
Tai Lung is free! I must warn Shifu.


00:30:49.600 --> 00:30:52.320
- Not going anywhere! Neither is he!
- Let go of me!


00:30:52.360 --> 00:30:53.440
Bring it up!


00:30:56.080 --> 00:30:57.520
Wait! Bring it back!


00:31:15.520 --> 00:31:19.360
- He's coming this way!
- He won't get far. Archers!


00:32:24.320 --> 00:32:27.440
We're dead. So very, very dead.


00:32:28.120 --> 00:32:30.080
Not yet we're not. Now!


00:33:15.840 --> 00:33:18.400
- Can we run now?
- Yes.


00:33:38.400 --> 00:33:39.760
I'm glad Shifu sent you.


00:33:41.920 --> 00:33:44.640
I was beginning to think
I'd been forgotten.


00:33:44.720 --> 00:33:46.680
Fly back there and tell them...


00:33:46.720 --> 00:33:50.320
...the real Dragon Warrior
is coming home.


00:34:01.800 --> 00:34:03.280
Good morning, Master!


00:34:04.680 --> 00:34:06.240
Panda!


00:34:06.320 --> 00:34:07.280
Panda!


00:34:07.640 --> 00:34:08.760
Wake up!


00:34:12.160 --> 00:34:13.360
He's quit.


00:34:15.280 --> 00:34:20.120
What do we do now, with the panda gone?
Who will be the Dragon Warrior?


00:34:20.200 --> 00:34:23.160
All we can do is resume our training
and trust that in time,


00:34:23.240 --> 00:34:25.760
the true Dragon Warrior
will be revealed.


00:34:27.200 --> 00:34:28.680
What are you doing here?!


00:34:29.600 --> 00:34:31.480
Hi! Good morning, Master!


00:34:31.600 --> 00:34:33.400
I thought I'd warm up a little.


00:34:35.440 --> 00:34:36.400
You're stuck.


00:34:36.480 --> 00:34:38.720
Stuck? Nah. What? Stuck?


00:34:39.680 --> 00:34:42.400
Nah. This is one of my...
Yeah, I'm stuck.


00:34:42.440 --> 00:34:44.320
- Help him.
- Oh, dear.


00:34:45.400 --> 00:34:47.760
Maybe on three. One, two...


00:34:48.800 --> 00:34:49.920
...three.


00:34:51.640 --> 00:34:53.240
- Thank you.
- Don't mention it.


00:34:53.280 --> 00:34:56.120
- No, really, I appreciate...
- Ever.


00:34:56.160 --> 00:35:00.320
You actually thought you could learn
to do a full split in one night?


00:35:00.360 --> 00:35:03.600
It takes years to develop
one's flexibility!


00:35:03.680 --> 00:35:07.280
And years longer to apply it in combat!


00:35:16.320 --> 00:35:17.760
Put that down!


00:35:17.840 --> 00:35:22.160
The only souvenirs we collect here are
bloody knuckles and broken bones.


00:35:22.240 --> 00:35:25.040
Yeah! Excellent.


00:35:25.800 --> 00:35:26.960
Let's get started.


00:35:29.160 --> 00:35:30.960
- Are you ready?
- I was born re...


00:35:32.840 --> 00:35:35.720
I'm sorry, brother.
I thought you said you were ready.


00:35:35.800 --> 00:35:38.960
That was awesome! Let's go again!


00:36:04.240 --> 00:36:07.040
I've been taking it easy on you, panda.
But no more.


00:36:07.120 --> 00:36:09.360
Your next opponent will be me.


00:36:09.440 --> 00:36:11.120
All right! Yeah, let's go!


00:36:13.520 --> 00:36:15.480
Step forth.


00:36:15.560 --> 00:36:18.880
The true path to victory is to find
your opponent's weakness...


00:36:18.960 --> 00:36:20.760
...and make him suffer for it.


00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:22.080
Oh, yeah!


00:36:22.160 --> 00:36:25.400
To take his strength
and use it against him...


00:36:25.440 --> 00:36:27.840
...until he finally falls...


00:36:27.960 --> 00:36:28.920
...or quits.


00:36:28.960 --> 00:36:30.840
A real warrior never quits.


00:36:30.920 --> 00:36:34.000
Don't worry, Master. I will never quit!


00:36:43.960 --> 00:36:47.040
If he's smart,
he won't come back up those steps.


00:36:47.080 --> 00:36:48.360
But he will.


00:36:48.440 --> 00:36:50.640
He's not going to quit, is he?


00:36:50.720 --> 00:36:53.360
He's not going to quit bouncing,
I'll tell you that.


00:37:04.760 --> 00:37:07.680
I thought you said acupuncture
would make me feel better.


00:37:07.760 --> 00:37:08.760
Trust me, it will.


00:37:08.800 --> 00:37:12.280
It's just not easy finding the right
nerve points under all this...


00:37:12.360 --> 00:37:14.920
- Fat?
- Fur. I was going to say fur.


00:37:15.000 --> 00:37:15.960
Sure you were.


00:37:16.000 --> 00:37:19.920
Who am I to judge a warrior
based on his size? Look at me.


00:37:21.040 --> 00:37:22.000
I'm over here.


00:37:23.040 --> 00:37:25.400
Maybe you should look at this again.


00:37:25.480 --> 00:37:27.800
Oh, OK.


00:37:30.480 --> 00:37:32.400
Stop it. Stop!


00:37:33.520 --> 00:37:36.320
I know Master Shifu is trying
to inspire me and all...


00:37:36.640 --> 00:37:40.160
...but if I didn't know better,
I'd say he was trying to get rid of me.


00:37:44.920 --> 00:37:47.200
I know he can seem kind of heartless...


00:37:47.840 --> 00:37:49.720
...but he wasn't always like that.


00:37:49.760 --> 00:37:51.040
According to legend,


00:37:51.120 --> 00:37:55.480
there was once a time when
Master Shifu actually used to smile.


00:37:55.520 --> 00:37:57.400
- No!
- Yes.


00:37:57.440 --> 00:37:58.680
But that was before.


00:37:58.720 --> 00:38:00.640
Before what?


00:38:00.720 --> 00:38:02.000
Before Tai Lung.


00:38:02.080 --> 00:38:04.560
We're not really supposed
to talk about him.


00:38:04.640 --> 00:38:07.480
Well, if he's going to stay here,
he should know.


00:38:07.560 --> 00:38:09.440
Guys, guys, I know about Tai Lung.


00:38:09.480 --> 00:38:14.720
He was a student. The first ever to
master the thousand scrolls of kung fu.


00:38:14.800 --> 00:38:18.800
And then he turned bad,
and now he's in jail.


00:38:18.880 --> 00:38:20.920
He wasn’t just a student.


00:38:25.080 --> 00:38:27.800
Shifu found him as a cub...


00:38:29.360 --> 00:38:32.160
...and he raised him as his son.


00:38:34.440 --> 00:38:37.400
And when the boy showed
talent in kung fu...


00:38:38.440 --> 00:38:40.640
...Shifu trained him.


00:38:40.680 --> 00:38:44.640
He believed in him. He told him
he was destined for greatness.


00:38:46.280 --> 00:38:47.960
It was never enough for Tai Lung.


00:38:50.560 --> 00:38:52.120
He wanted the Dragon Scroll.


00:38:52.160 --> 00:38:56.320
But Oogway saw darkness
in his heart and refused.


00:38:56.640 --> 00:39:00.160
Outraged, Tai Lung
laid waste to the valley.


00:39:02.560 --> 00:39:04.480
He tried to take the scroll by force.


00:39:04.560 --> 00:39:08.960
And Shifu had to destroy
what he had created.


00:39:10.880 --> 00:39:12.360
But how could he?


00:39:25.920 --> 00:39:29.920
Shifu loved Tai Lung
like he had never loved anyone before.


00:39:37.840 --> 00:39:39.040
Or since.


00:39:47.200 --> 00:39:49.920
And now he has a chance
to make things right.


00:39:50.000 --> 00:39:52.160
To train the true Dragon Warrior.


00:39:52.200 --> 00:39:55.120
And he's stuck with you.


00:39:55.200 --> 00:39:58.880
A big fat panda
who treats it like a joke.


00:39:59.760 --> 00:40:00.720
That is it!


00:40:00.800 --> 00:40:03.800
Wait! My fault!
I accidentally tweaked his facial nerve.


00:40:06.120 --> 00:40:08.480
And may have also stopped his heart.


00:40:12.000 --> 00:40:13.520
Inner peace.


00:40:14.720 --> 00:40:16.640
Inner peace.


00:40:19.520 --> 00:40:21.120
Inner...


00:40:22.680 --> 00:40:24.480
Inner peace.


00:40:27.360 --> 00:40:31.680
Would whoever is making
that flapping sound quiet down?!


00:40:34.800 --> 00:40:36.000
Inner...


00:40:40.440 --> 00:40:42.400
Oh, Zeng.


00:40:42.480 --> 00:40:44.000
Excellent.


00:40:44.080 --> 00:40:45.920
I could use some good news right now.


00:40:53.400 --> 00:40:54.720
Master! Master!


00:40:55.360 --> 00:40:59.440
I have... It's...
It's very bad news.


00:40:59.520 --> 00:41:01.760
Shifu.


00:41:01.840 --> 00:41:05.120
There is just news.
There is no good or bad.


00:41:05.160 --> 00:41:08.680
Master, your vision.
Your vision was right.


00:41:08.760 --> 00:41:12.000
Tai Lung has broken out of prison.
He's on his way.


00:41:13.440 --> 00:41:16.040
That is bad news...


00:41:16.120 --> 00:41:20.280
...if you do not believe
that the Dragon Warrior can stop him.


00:41:20.320 --> 00:41:24.440
The panda? Master,
that panda is not the Dragon Warrior.


00:41:24.480 --> 00:41:27.680
He wasn't meant to be here!
It was an accident.


00:41:27.720 --> 00:41:29.920
There are no accidents.


00:41:31.120 --> 00:41:34.120
Yes, I know. You've said that already.


00:41:34.200 --> 00:41:38.200
- Twice.
- Well, that was no accident, either.


00:41:38.280 --> 00:41:39.320
Thrice.


00:41:39.400 --> 00:41:40.960
My old friend,


00:41:41.040 --> 00:41:45.440
the panda will never fulfill
his destiny, nor you yours,


00:41:45.520 --> 00:41:48.920
until you let go
of the illusion of control.


00:41:49.000 --> 00:41:50.320
Illusion?


00:41:50.400 --> 00:41:53.240
Yes. Look at this tree, Shifu.


00:41:53.320 --> 00:41:56.240
I cannot make it blossom
when it suits me,


00:41:56.320 --> 00:41:59.440
nor make it bear fruit
before its time.


00:41:59.520 --> 00:42:01.920
But there are things we can control.


00:42:02.960 --> 00:42:05.920
I can control when the fruit will fall.


00:42:06.960 --> 00:42:08.600
And I can control...


00:42:09.600 --> 00:42:11.520
...where to plant the seed.


00:42:12.000 --> 00:42:14.040
That is no illusion, Master.


00:42:15.600 --> 00:42:17.520
Yes.


00:42:17.600 --> 00:42:19.880
But no matter what you do


00:42:19.960 --> 00:42:22.760
that seed will grow to be a peach tree.


00:42:22.840 --> 00:42:27.520
You may wish for an apple or an orange,
but you will get a peach.


00:42:27.560 --> 00:42:31.040
But a peach cannot defeat Tai Lung!


00:42:31.120 --> 00:42:33.680
Maybe it can.


00:42:33.760 --> 00:42:36.440
If you are willing to guide it.


00:42:36.480 --> 00:42:38.280
To nurture it.


00:42:38.360 --> 00:42:39.680
To believe in it.


00:42:39.760 --> 00:42:42.120
But how? How?


00:42:42.200 --> 00:42:44.080
I need your help, Master.


00:42:44.160 --> 00:42:47.680
No, you just need to believe.


00:42:48.360 --> 00:42:50.560
Promise me, Shifu.


00:42:51.160 --> 00:42:53.720
Promise me you will believe.


00:42:53.800 --> 00:42:57.240
I will try.


00:42:58.040 --> 00:42:59.480
Good.


00:43:01.560 --> 00:43:03.520
My time has come.


00:43:05.640 --> 00:43:09.840
You must continue
your journey without me.


00:43:09.920 --> 00:43:11.560
What are you? Wait!


00:43:13.600 --> 00:43:14.840
Master!


00:43:15.640 --> 00:43:17.120
You can't leave me!


00:43:20.760 --> 00:43:23.280
You must believe.


00:43:24.160 --> 00:43:25.720
Master!


00:43:54.880 --> 00:43:57.440
Yeah, so I'm like,
"Fine, you may be a wolf,


00:43:57.520 --> 00:44:00.320
you may be the scariest bandit
in Haijin Province...


00:44:00.640 --> 00:44:02.400
...but you're a lousy tipper."


00:44:02.480 --> 00:44:05.280
Really? So how did you
get out of there alive?


00:44:06.120 --> 00:44:08.320
I mean, I didn't actually say that...


00:44:08.640 --> 00:44:10.080
...but I thought it...


00:44:10.120 --> 00:44:11.840
...in my mind.


00:44:11.880 --> 00:44:14.840
If he could read my mind,
he'd be, like, "What?"


00:44:15.360 --> 00:44:17.440
Order up! Hope you like it.


00:44:19.280 --> 00:44:22.400
- This is really good!
- No, come on.


00:44:22.440 --> 00:44:26.560
Try my dad's Secret Ingredient Soup.
He actually knows the secret ingredient.


00:44:26.640 --> 00:44:28.960
What do you mean? This is amazing!


00:44:29.000 --> 00:44:31.840
- You're a really good cook.
- I wish my mouth was bigger.


00:44:31.880 --> 00:44:33.720
Tigress, you've got to try this.


00:44:33.760 --> 00:44:37.240
It is said that the Dragon Warrior
can survive for months


00:44:37.320 --> 00:44:41.920
on nothing but the dew of ginkgo leaf
and the energy of the universe.


00:44:43.240 --> 00:44:47.000
I guess my body doesn't know
it's the Dragon Warrior yet.


00:44:47.040 --> 00:44:51.840
I'm gonna need a lot more
than dew and universe juice.


00:44:56.080 --> 00:44:59.040
- What?
- Nothing... Master Shifu.


00:45:01.720 --> 00:45:05.560
Never be the Dragon Warrior unless you
lose 500 pounds and brush your teeth!


00:45:06.760 --> 00:45:10.080
What is that noise you're making?
Laughter? I never heard of it!


00:45:10.120 --> 00:45:12.840
Work hard, panda, and maybe someday...


00:45:12.920 --> 00:45:14.720
...you will have ears like mine.


00:45:16.280 --> 00:45:17.600
That's good.


00:45:18.200 --> 00:45:21.440
Ears. It's not working for you?
I thought they were pretty good.


00:45:21.760 --> 00:45:22.840
It's Shifu!


00:45:22.920 --> 00:45:25.640
Of course it's Shifu.
What do you think I'm doing?


00:45:27.360 --> 00:45:28.920
Master Shifu!


00:45:31.840 --> 00:45:33.440
You think this is funny?


00:45:33.520 --> 00:45:36.360
Tai Lung has escaped
and you're acting like children!


00:45:36.440 --> 00:45:38.640
- What?
- He is coming for the Dragon Scroll,


00:45:38.720 --> 00:45:40.960
and you are the only one
who can stop him.


00:45:44.480 --> 00:45:47.000
And I was saying
you got no sense of humor.


00:45:47.080 --> 00:45:49.280
I'm gonna... stop Tai Lung.


00:45:49.360 --> 00:45:52.080
What? You're serious? And I have to?


00:45:53.880 --> 00:45:56.720
Master Oogway will stop him,
like he did before.


00:45:56.800 --> 00:45:58.240
Oogway cannot!


00:45:58.720 --> 00:46:00.080
Not anymore.


00:46:01.520 --> 00:46:04.120
Our only hope is the Dragon Warrior.


00:46:04.160 --> 00:46:05.720
- The panda?
- Yes, the panda!


00:46:05.800 --> 00:46:09.240
Master, let us stop Tai Lung.
This is what you've trained us for.


00:46:09.320 --> 00:46:12.760
No! It is not your destiny
to defeat Tai Lung.


00:46:12.800 --> 00:46:14.360
It is his!


00:46:14.400 --> 00:46:15.480
Where'd he go?


00:46:22.560 --> 00:46:25.720
You cannot leave!
A real warrior never quits.


00:46:25.760 --> 00:46:27.280
Watch me.


00:46:29.760 --> 00:46:30.840
Come on.


00:46:30.880 --> 00:46:34.560
How am I supposed to beat Tai Lung?
I can't even beat you to the stairs.


00:46:34.640 --> 00:46:37.520
You will beat him
because you are the Dragon Warrior.


00:46:38.280 --> 00:46:41.440
You don't believe that.
You never believed that.


00:46:41.480 --> 00:46:44.360
From the beginning,
you've tried to get rid of me.


00:46:44.440 --> 00:46:46.680
Yes! I was.


00:46:46.720 --> 00:46:51.640
But now I ask you to trust in your
master as I have come to trust in mine.


00:46:52.680 --> 00:46:56.280
You're not my master.
And I'm not the Dragon Warrior.


00:46:56.320 --> 00:47:00.480
Then why didn't you quit?! You knew
I wanted you gone, yet you stayed.


00:47:00.600 --> 00:47:02.520
Yeah, I stayed.


00:47:02.560 --> 00:47:06.200
I stayed because every time
you threw a brick at my head


00:47:06.240 --> 00:47:10.480
or said I smelled, it hurt,
but it could never hurt more


00:47:10.560 --> 00:47:13.640
than it did every day
of my life just being me.


00:47:14.560 --> 00:47:18.720
I stayed because I thought,
if anyone could change me...


00:47:19.040 --> 00:47:22.000
...could make me... not me...


00:47:22.080 --> 00:47:23.360
...it was you.


00:47:23.600 --> 00:47:26.440
The greatest kung fu teacher
in all of China!


00:47:26.520 --> 00:47:28.040
But I can change you!


00:47:28.120 --> 00:47:31.480
I can turn you into the Dragon Warrior!
And I will!


00:47:31.560 --> 00:47:35.400
Come on. Tai Lung is
on his way here right now.


00:47:35.480 --> 00:47:38.720
Even if it takes him a hundred years
to get here, how are you...


00:47:38.800 --> 00:47:42.880
...gonna change this
into the Dragon Warrior?


00:47:45.120 --> 00:47:46.040
How?


00:47:47.640 --> 00:47:48.600
How?


00:47:51.520 --> 00:47:53.600
- How?!
- I don't know!


00:48:01.320 --> 00:48:02.840
I don't know.


00:48:09.120 --> 00:48:11.280
That's what I thought.


00:48:48.320 --> 00:48:50.400
This is what you trained me for.


00:48:57.280 --> 00:48:58.200
Tigress!


00:49:02.280 --> 00:49:04.000
Don't try and stop me.


00:49:06.640 --> 00:49:08.120
We're not trying to stop you.


00:49:08.160 --> 00:49:09.120
What?


00:49:09.200 --> 00:49:11.000
We're coming with you!


00:50:21.160 --> 00:50:24.560
What? I eat when I'm upset, OK?


00:50:25.760 --> 00:50:27.040
No need to explain.


00:50:27.120 --> 00:50:31.120
I thought you might be Monkey. He hides
his almond cookies on the top shelf.


00:50:51.200 --> 00:50:52.800
Don't tell Monkey.


00:50:52.880 --> 00:50:55.920
- Look at you.
- Yeah, I know, I disgust you.


00:50:56.000 --> 00:50:58.840
No, I mean, how did you get up there?


00:50:58.920 --> 00:51:01.560
I don't know. I guess that...


00:51:01.920 --> 00:51:04.120
I don't know. I was getting a cookie.


00:51:04.160 --> 00:51:06.000
Yet you are ten feet off the ground.


00:51:07.000 --> 00:51:09.240
And you have done a perfect spilt.


00:51:09.280 --> 00:51:12.160
No, this? This is just...


00:51:12.840 --> 00:51:14.120
...an accident.


00:51:18.200 --> 00:51:21.120
There are no accidents.


00:51:21.200 --> 00:51:22.200
Come with me.


00:51:29.920 --> 00:51:33.200
I know you're trying to be
all mystical and kung fuey...


00:51:33.280 --> 00:51:35.880
...but could you at least
tell me where we're going?


00:51:45.400 --> 00:51:47.760
You dragged me...


00:51:47.840 --> 00:51:49.480
...all the way out here...


00:51:49.520 --> 00:51:50.800
...for a bath?


00:51:54.280 --> 00:51:55.560
Panda...


00:51:55.640 --> 00:51:59.120
...we do not wash our pits
in the Pool of Sacred Tears.


00:52:00.320 --> 00:52:01.280
The Pool of...


00:52:01.360 --> 00:52:03.840
This is where Oogway
unraveled the mysteries...


00:52:03.920 --> 00:52:06.040
...of harmony and focus.


00:52:06.080 --> 00:52:08.520
This is the birthplace...


00:52:08.600 --> 00:52:09.800
...of kung fu.


00:52:23.200 --> 00:52:25.400
Do you want to learn kung fu?


00:52:25.440 --> 00:52:26.400
Yeah!


00:52:26.480 --> 00:52:29.600
Then I am your master!


00:52:29.680 --> 00:52:31.360
OK!


00:52:32.640 --> 00:52:33.720
Don't cry.


00:52:33.760 --> 00:52:35.040
OK.


00:52:40.560 --> 00:52:42.480
When you focus on kung fu,


00:52:42.560 --> 00:52:44.600
when you concentrate...


00:52:44.680 --> 00:52:46.080
...you stink.


00:52:46.120 --> 00:52:47.960
Perhaps that is my fault.


00:52:48.000 --> 00:52:51.320
I cannot train you the way
I have trained the Five.


00:52:51.400 --> 00:52:54.360
I now see that the way
to get through to you...


00:52:54.440 --> 00:52:55.680
...is with this.


00:52:55.760 --> 00:52:58.400
Oh, great, 'cause I am hungry.


00:52:59.280 --> 00:53:00.280
Good.


00:53:00.360 --> 00:53:02.960
When you have been trained, you may eat.


00:53:04.320 --> 00:53:05.440
Let us begin.


00:54:13.280 --> 00:54:14.320
After you, panda.


00:54:14.400 --> 00:54:16.280
Just like that?


00:54:16.320 --> 00:54:19.840
No sit-ups? No ten-mile hike?


00:54:19.920 --> 00:54:24.240
I vowed to train you, and you
have been trained. You are free to eat.


00:54:29.440 --> 00:54:30.960
Enjoy.


00:54:32.480 --> 00:54:33.840
Hey!


00:54:33.920 --> 00:54:36.920
I said you are free to eat.
Have a dumpling.


00:54:38.200 --> 00:54:39.600
Hey!


00:54:45.600 --> 00:54:47.520
You are free to eat.


00:54:47.560 --> 00:54:49.400
- Am I?!
- Are you?!


00:56:12.240 --> 00:56:13.720
I'm not hungry.


00:56:17.160 --> 00:56:18.320
Master.


00:56:47.200 --> 00:56:48.480
Out it!


00:57:04.960 --> 00:57:06.720
Where's the Dragon Warrior?


00:57:06.760 --> 00:57:09.640
How do you know
you're not looking at her?


00:57:09.720 --> 00:57:11.800
You think I'm a fool?


00:57:11.880 --> 00:57:15.360
I know you're not the Dragon Warrior.
None of you!


00:57:15.440 --> 00:57:18.560
I heard how he fell out
of the sky in a ball of fire.


00:57:18.640 --> 00:57:22.880
That he's a warrior unlike
anything the world has ever seen.


00:57:22.960 --> 00:57:28.320
- Po?
- So that is his name. Po.


00:57:28.400 --> 00:57:31.360
Finally, a worthy opponent.


00:57:31.440 --> 00:57:33.840
Our battle will be legendary!


00:57:53.000 --> 00:57:54.640
We've got this. Help her.


00:58:18.240 --> 00:58:19.200
Monkey!


00:58:19.280 --> 00:58:21.040
Go!


00:58:21.120 --> 00:58:22.240
What was I thinking?!


00:58:32.240 --> 00:58:33.240
Mantis!


00:58:38.240 --> 00:58:39.640
Now!


00:59:23.680 --> 00:59:25.880
Shifu taught you well.


00:59:28.720 --> 00:59:30.560
But he didn't teach you everything.


00:59:34.520 --> 00:59:35.960
You have done well, panda.


00:59:36.000 --> 00:59:39.560
Done well? Done well?


00:59:39.640 --> 00:59:40.880
I've done awesome!


00:59:42.520 --> 00:59:45.560
The mark of a true hero is humility.


00:59:45.640 --> 00:59:48.240
But, yes, you have done...


00:59:48.800 --> 00:59:50.080
...awesome.


00:59:57.040 --> 01:00:00.240
Guys? Guys?! They're dead!


01:00:00.320 --> 01:00:03.600
No, they're breathing. They're asleep?
But their eyes are open.


01:00:03.680 --> 01:00:05.560
We were no match for his nerve attach.


01:00:05.640 --> 01:00:07.800
He's gotten stronger.


01:00:07.840 --> 01:00:10.080
Who? Tai Lung? Stronger?


01:00:11.200 --> 01:00:12.160
He's too fast!


01:00:12.240 --> 01:00:13.720
Sorry, Po.


01:00:15.720 --> 01:00:17.240
I thought we could stop him.


01:00:17.280 --> 01:00:19.040
He could have killed you.


01:00:19.120 --> 01:00:20.120
Why didn't he?


01:00:20.200 --> 01:00:24.440
So you could come back and strike fear
into our hearts. But it won't work.


01:00:24.520 --> 01:00:28.640
It might. I mean, a little.


01:00:28.680 --> 01:00:29.880
I'm pretty scared.


01:00:29.920 --> 01:00:31.360
You can defeat him, panda!


01:00:31.440 --> 01:00:34.240
Are you kidding? If they can't?!


01:00:34.320 --> 01:00:37.200
They're five masters. I'm just one me.


01:00:37.280 --> 01:00:40.480
But you will have
the one thing that no one else does.


01:00:45.600 --> 01:00:48.000
You really believe I'm ready?


01:00:48.080 --> 01:00:49.680
You are...


01:00:49.760 --> 01:00:51.000
...Po.


01:01:37.920 --> 01:01:41.360
Behold the Dragon Scroll.


01:01:41.440 --> 01:01:43.280
It is yours.


01:01:43.360 --> 01:01:46.160
Wait. What happens when I read it?


01:01:46.240 --> 01:01:50.080
Legend says you will be able
to hear a butterfly's wing beat.


01:01:50.160 --> 01:01:52.280
Really? That's cool.


01:01:52.360 --> 01:01:55.080
Yes. And see light in the deepest cave.


01:01:55.160 --> 01:01:57.920
You will feel the universe
in motion around you.


01:01:58.560 --> 01:01:59.960
Can I punch through walls?


01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:02.280
- Do a quadruple back flip?
- Focus.


01:02:02.360 --> 01:02:03.480
- Will I?
- Focus.


01:02:03.880 --> 01:02:05.240
- Focus.
- Oh, yeah, yeah.


01:02:05.280 --> 01:02:08.080
Read it, Po, and fulfill your destiny.


01:02:08.160 --> 01:02:10.240
Read it and become...


01:02:10.320 --> 01:02:11.960
...the Dragon Warrior.


01:02:18.600 --> 01:02:20.000
It's impossible to open.


01:02:20.920 --> 01:02:24.000
OK. Come on, baby. Come on now.


01:02:26.160 --> 01:02:27.720
Thank you.


01:02:27.800 --> 01:02:30.080
I probably loosened it up
for you though.


01:02:31.360 --> 01:02:32.800
OK, here goes.


01:02:44.320 --> 01:02:45.920
- It's blank.
- What?!


01:02:46.000 --> 01:02:49.440
- Here, look.
- No, I am forbidden to look upon...


01:02:54.920 --> 01:02:57.680
Blank. I don't...


01:02:57.760 --> 01:02:59.840
I don't understand.


01:03:01.120 --> 01:03:03.680
OK. So, like...


01:03:03.760 --> 01:03:06.840
...Oogway was
just a crazy old turtle after all.


01:03:06.920 --> 01:03:09.400
No. Oogway was wiser than us all.


01:03:09.480 --> 01:03:13.400
Oh, come on! Face it,
he picked me by accident.


01:03:13.440 --> 01:03:17.400
Of course I'm not the Dragon Warrior.
Who am I kidding?


01:03:18.400 --> 01:03:20.040
But who will stop Tai Lung?


01:03:20.120 --> 01:03:22.520
He'll destroy everything and everyone.


01:03:22.560 --> 01:03:24.160
No.


01:03:24.480 --> 01:03:29.760
Evacuate the valley. You must protect
the villagers from Tai Lung's rage.


01:03:29.840 --> 01:03:32.160
- What about you, Master?
- I will fight him.


01:03:32.200 --> 01:03:34.800
- What?
- I can hold him off long enough


01:03:34.880 --> 01:03:36.280
for everyone to escape.


01:03:36.320 --> 01:03:38.680
But, Shifu, he'll kill you.


01:03:38.720 --> 01:03:41.440
Then I will finally have paid
for my mistake.


01:03:42.400 --> 01:03:44.400
Listen to me, all of you.


01:03:44.480 --> 01:03:47.840
It is time for you to continue
your journey without me.


01:03:47.920 --> 01:03:50.800
I am very proud
to have been your master.


01:04:10.720 --> 01:04:13.000
We've got to get them out safely.


01:04:13.080 --> 01:04:15.320
Come, little one. Let's find your mama.


01:04:15.400 --> 01:04:18.760
Viper, gather the southern farmers.
Mantis, the north.


01:04:18.800 --> 01:04:20.480
Orange, light the way.


01:04:38.760 --> 01:04:41.680
Look, it's the Dragon Warrior.


01:04:50.040 --> 01:04:51.360
Hey, Dad.


01:04:51.960 --> 01:04:53.200
Po!


01:04:58.880 --> 01:05:00.880
Good to have you back, son.


01:05:03.240 --> 01:05:04.680
Good to be back.


01:05:04.760 --> 01:05:06.320
Let's go, Po.


01:05:08.720 --> 01:05:11.440
So for our next shop,
it's time to face it...


01:05:11.680 --> 01:05:15.040
...the future of noodles
is dice-cut vegetables...


01:05:15.360 --> 01:05:17.400
...no longer slices.


01:05:17.440 --> 01:05:20.760
Also, I was thinking, maybe this time


01:05:20.800 --> 01:05:23.840
we'll have a kitchen
you can actually stand up in.


01:05:25.120 --> 01:05:26.240
You like that?


01:05:32.160 --> 01:05:36.560
Po, I'm sorry if things didn't work out.


01:05:36.640 --> 01:05:39.520
It just wasn't meant to be.


01:05:42.880 --> 01:05:45.240
Po, forget everything else.


01:05:45.320 --> 01:05:47.440
Your destiny still awaits.


01:05:47.520 --> 01:05:52.080
We are noodle folk.
Broth runs deep through our veins.


01:05:52.160 --> 01:05:54.360
I don't know, Dad.


01:05:54.400 --> 01:05:58.240
Honestly, sometimes
I can't believe I'm actually your son.


01:06:01.480 --> 01:06:02.520
Po...


01:06:02.600 --> 01:06:06.880
...I think it's time I told you
something I should have told you...


01:06:06.920 --> 01:06:08.920
...a long time ago.


01:06:08.960 --> 01:06:10.640
OK.


01:06:11.960 --> 01:06:15.920
The secret ingredient
of my Secret Ingredient Soup.


01:06:18.560 --> 01:06:23.000
Come here. The secret ingredient is...


01:06:23.040 --> 01:06:24.000
...nothing.


01:06:25.440 --> 01:06:27.760
You heard me. Nothing!


01:06:27.840 --> 01:06:30.200
There is no secret ingredient!


01:06:30.240 --> 01:06:33.200
Wait, wait.
It's just plain old noodle soup?


01:06:33.280 --> 01:06:36.000
You don't add some kind of special
sauce or something?


01:06:36.080 --> 01:06:40.320
Don't have to. To make something
special, you just believe it's special.


01:06:50.560 --> 01:06:52.920
There is no secret ingredient.


01:07:14.600 --> 01:07:17.280
I have come home, Master.


01:07:17.360 --> 01:07:20.480
This is no longer your home.
And I am no longer your master.


01:07:20.560 --> 01:07:24.320
Oh, yes. You have a new favorite.


01:07:24.400 --> 01:07:27.360
So where is this Po?


01:07:28.760 --> 01:07:29.920
Did I scare him off?


01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:32.240
This battle is between you and me.


01:07:33.600 --> 01:07:36.880
So, that is how it's going to be.


01:07:36.960 --> 01:07:38.880
That is how it must be.


01:07:52.480 --> 01:07:56.840
I rotted in jail for 20 years
because of your weakness!


01:07:56.920 --> 01:07:59.200
Obeying your master is not weakness!


01:07:59.240 --> 01:08:01.920
You knew I was the Dragon Warrior.


01:08:02.000 --> 01:08:04.080
You always knew.


01:08:04.160 --> 01:08:08.880
But when Oogway said otherwise,
what did you do?


01:08:09.960 --> 01:08:12.400
What did you do?!


01:08:14.840 --> 01:08:15.920
Nothing!


01:08:16.000 --> 01:08:18.720
You were not meant to be the Dragon
Warrior! That was not my fault!


01:08:18.760 --> 01:08:20.640
Not your fault?!


01:08:20.720 --> 01:08:22.680
Who filled my head with dreams?!


01:08:22.760 --> 01:08:24.920
Who drove me to train
until my bones cracked?!


01:08:24.960 --> 01:08:27.600
Who denied me my destiny?!


01:08:36.480 --> 01:08:38.960
It was never my decision to make!


01:08:44.200 --> 01:08:45.440
It is now.


01:08:50.320 --> 01:08:53.920
Give me the scroll!


01:08:54.000 --> 01:08:55.160
I would rather die.


01:09:43.280 --> 01:09:46.240
All I ever did, I did to make you proud!


01:09:46.400 --> 01:09:48.800
Tell me how proud you are, Shifu!


01:09:49.760 --> 01:09:51.160
Tell me!


01:09:51.680 --> 01:09:53.360
Tell me!


01:10:03.240 --> 01:10:06.480
I have...
I have always been proud of you.


01:10:07.560 --> 01:10:10.760
From the first moment, I've been...


01:10:10.840 --> 01:10:13.040
...proud of you.


01:10:13.120 --> 01:10:15.360
And it was my pride...


01:10:15.440 --> 01:10:17.400
...that blinded me.


01:10:17.440 --> 01:10:20.880
I loved you too much
to see what you were becoming...


01:10:21.840 --> 01:10:24.000
...what I...


01:10:24.080 --> 01:10:26.000
...was turning you into.


01:10:26.760 --> 01:10:28.640
I'm...


01:10:28.720 --> 01:10:29.680
I'm sorry.


01:10:37.840 --> 01:10:40.440
I don't want your apology.


01:10:40.520 --> 01:10:42.000
I want my scroll!


01:10:44.000 --> 01:10:46.240
What?!


01:10:46.320 --> 01:10:47.480
Where is it?!


01:10:48.480 --> 01:10:52.880
Dragon Warrior has taken the scroll
halfway across China by now.


01:10:53.960 --> 01:10:56.960
You will never see
that scroll, Tai Lung.


01:10:57.040 --> 01:10:58.320
Never.


01:10:59.200 --> 01:11:00.160
Never.


01:11:06.840 --> 01:11:08.080
Stairs.


01:11:10.400 --> 01:11:12.120
Who are you?


01:11:12.200 --> 01:11:17.040
Buddy, I am the Dragon Warrior.


01:11:19.920 --> 01:11:21.200
You?


01:11:22.120 --> 01:11:24.000
Him? He's a panda.


01:11:24.080 --> 01:11:27.800
You're a panda. What are
you gonna do, big guy? Sit on me?


01:11:27.840 --> 01:11:29.720
Don't tempt me.


01:11:29.760 --> 01:11:33.640
No. I'm gonna use this.


01:11:33.720 --> 01:11:35.280
You want it? Come and get it.


01:11:36.960 --> 01:11:38.200
Finally!


01:12:03.080 --> 01:12:04.480
That scroll is mine!


01:12:56.040 --> 01:12:57.040
Lightning!


01:13:30.800 --> 01:13:32.720
The scroll has given him power!


01:13:33.320 --> 01:13:34.840
No!


01:14:09.800 --> 01:14:13.600
Finally! Oh, yes.


01:14:13.640 --> 01:14:18.320
The power of the Dragon Scroll is mine!


01:14:22.440 --> 01:14:24.400
It's nothing!


01:14:26.280 --> 01:14:28.760
It's OK. I didn't get it
the first time, either.


01:14:29.520 --> 01:14:30.520
What?


01:14:31.680 --> 01:14:33.400
There is no secret ingredient.


01:14:36.800 --> 01:14:38.000
It's just you.


01:14:47.360 --> 01:14:48.400
Stop it!


01:14:48.480 --> 01:14:50.160
I'm gonna pee.


01:14:51.680 --> 01:14:53.240
Don't.


01:14:53.280 --> 01:14:54.880
Don't! Don't!


01:15:59.400 --> 01:16:01.120
You...


01:16:01.200 --> 01:16:03.320
...can't defeat me.


01:16:07.600 --> 01:16:08.760
You...


01:16:10.080 --> 01:16:11.800
...you're just a big...


01:16:11.840 --> 01:16:13.400
...fat...


01:16:13.440 --> 01:16:14.400
...panda!


01:16:15.360 --> 01:16:18.360
I'm not a big fat panda.


01:16:18.400 --> 01:16:20.600
I'm the big fat panda.


01:16:22.800 --> 01:16:24.160
The Wuxi Finger Hold!


01:16:24.240 --> 01:16:25.600
Oh, you know this hold?


01:16:25.680 --> 01:16:29.480
You're bluffing. You're bluffing.
Shifu didn't teach you that.


01:16:29.560 --> 01:16:31.160
Nope.


01:16:31.240 --> 01:16:33.360
I figured it out. Skadoosh.


01:16:53.040 --> 01:16:54.200
Look!


01:16:55.200 --> 01:16:57.240
The Dragon Warrior.


01:17:23.560 --> 01:17:28.240
That's my boy! That big lovely
kung fu warrior is my son!


01:17:30.240 --> 01:17:31.280
Yes!


01:17:32.480 --> 01:17:34.000
Thanks, Dad.


01:17:42.880 --> 01:17:44.240
Hey, guys.


01:17:48.800 --> 01:17:50.080
Master.


01:17:50.120 --> 01:17:51.520
Master.


01:17:54.280 --> 01:17:55.960
Master?


01:17:56.040 --> 01:17:57.440
Master Shifu!


01:18:09.960 --> 01:18:11.280
Master!


01:18:11.360 --> 01:18:13.360
Shifu, are you OK?!


01:18:15.640 --> 01:18:16.960
Po.


01:18:17.040 --> 01:18:18.880
You're alive.


01:18:18.960 --> 01:18:20.120
Or we're both dead.


01:18:20.200 --> 01:18:24.000
No, Master, I didn't die.
I defeated Tai Lung.


01:18:24.040 --> 01:18:25.120
You did?


01:18:29.240 --> 01:18:34.720
Wow. It is as Oogway foretold.


01:18:34.800 --> 01:18:38.160
You are the Dragon Warrior.


01:18:38.880 --> 01:18:41.240
You have brought peace...


01:18:41.280 --> 01:18:43.960
...to this valley...


01:18:44.000 --> 01:18:46.120
...and...


01:18:46.200 --> 01:18:47.760
...and to me.


01:18:47.840 --> 01:18:49.040
Thank you.


01:18:50.800 --> 01:18:53.880
Thank you, Po.


01:18:53.960 --> 01:18:56.440
Thank you. Thank you.


01:19:01.760 --> 01:19:06.520
No! Master! No, no, no,
don't die, Shifu, please!


01:19:06.600 --> 01:19:09.240
I'm not dying, you idiot!


01:19:09.280 --> 01:19:11.200
Dragon Warrior...


01:19:12.400 --> 01:19:17.040
...I am simply at peace. Finally.


01:19:19.680 --> 01:19:22.480
So, I should stop talking?


01:19:23.160 --> 01:19:24.720
If you can.


01:19:42.080 --> 01:19:43.600
Want to get something to eat?


01:19:46.160 --> 01:19:47.200
Yeah.


01:19:52.960 --> 01:19:56.240
Everybody is kung fu fighting


01:19:57.040 --> 01:20:00.240
Your mind becomes fast as lightning


01:20:01.200 --> 01:20:04.400
Although the future
is a little bit frightening


01:20:05.520 --> 01:20:08.880
It's the book of your life
that you're writing


